      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nyencakare nk'aga magingo encuro y'esaano y'obunono neija kugura shekeli, emwe, n'encuro ibiri za sayiri zigure shekeli emwe, aha irembo rya Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuru w'engabo, ou omugabe yaabaire ayegamira omukono gwe yaagira omushaija wa Ruhanga ati: Noogira ngu n'obu MUKAMA wenka yaakuta amadirisa omu iguru, ekigambo eki kikaabaho? Onu ati: Noija kukireeba n'amaisho gaawe, kwonka torikwija kubiryaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.13.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 13:46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi obwo hakaba hariho abashaija bana ababembire bari aha irembo; baagambirana bonka bati: N'enki ekitushutamiise aha, okuhitsya obu turaafe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba ku turaagire tuti, Ka tutaahe omu rurembo, orurembo rurimu enjara nitwija kugwamu; kandi hoona n'obu turaagume tushutami aha, nabwo nitwija kufa. N'ahabw'ekyo mwije twambukye twegyeme orusiisira rw'Abasiria; ku baraaturekye, tugumeho; ku baraatwite, biri twafiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baimuka omu rwita-waabo kuza omu rusiisira rw'Abasiria. Ku baahikire ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, baashanga hatarimu muntu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 6:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahakuba MUKAMA akaba areeteire engabo z'Abasiria kuhurira okuhinda kw'ebigaari n'embaraasi, n'endigito y'eihe rihango, kyabareetera kugambirana bati: Yeimwe, omugabe wa Israeli aguririire abagabe b'Abahiiti n'ab'Abanyamisri kututeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.28.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 28:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baimuka omu rwita-waabo, baacwa, baatsigaho amahema gaabo, embaraasi zaabo n'endogoya zaabo, orusiisira rwona nk'oku rwabaire ruri, baahunga ngu bakize amagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo babembe ku baahikire ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, baataaha omu ihema rimwe, baarya, baanywa, baihamu efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebijwaro, baagyenda, baabishereka; baagaruka baataaha omu rindi ihema, baihamu ebindi, baagyenda, baabishereka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima baagambirana bati: Ebi turikukora tibihikire. Eizooba eri n'eizooba ry'amakuru marungi, haza tuhunami; ku turaarekye bukataagurukana, nitwija kugiibwaho ekiheneso. N'ahabw'ekyo mwije tugyende, tugambire ab'omu nju y'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo baagyenda; ku baahikire aha irembo, baayeta omurinzi w'eirembo, baamugira bati: Twahika omu rusiisira rw'Abasiria, twashanga rutarimu muntu n'obu kaakuba akateezo, kureka embaraasi n'endogoya azitsibikire, kandi n'amahema gari nk'oku gabaire gari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo murinzi yaayeta abandi, baabigambira ab'omu nju y'omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe yaimuka nyekiro, yaagambira abaheereza be ati: Ka mbagambire enaama ei Abasiria batugiriire. Bamanyire ku enjara etwitsire; nikyo barugiire omu rusiisira, bakeeshereka omu ishwa, nibateekateeka bati: Ku baraashohore omu rurembo, nitwija kubagurukana, tubakwate bahuriire, tweshukye n'omu rurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwe aha baheereza be yaagira ati: Ka batware embaraasi itaano ahari ezo ezitsigaire omu rurembo; mbwenu torikumanya ku zirembire nk'Abaisraeli boona abatsigaire omu rurembo, abahonokire ahari abao abafiire; tutumeyo, tureebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baareeta abashaija babiri b'embaraasi, omugabe yaaboohereza kukurata eihe ry'Abasiria, naagira ati: Mugyende mureebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabakurata okuhika Yorudani, baashanga omuhanda gwona gwijwire ebijwaro n'ebintu ebi Abasiria banagire nibairuka. Ezo ntumwa zaagaruka zaagambira omugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
