        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abantu baashohora, baanyaga orusiisira rw'Abasiria. N'ahabw'ekyo encuro y'esaano y'obunono yaagura shekeli emwe, n'encuro ebiri za sayiri zaagura shekeli emwe, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.6.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 6:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eryo izooba omugabe yaaragiira omukuru w'engabo, ou yaabaire ayegamira omukono, kurinda eirembo. Abantu baamuribatiiririra omu irembo, yaafa, nk'oku omushaija wa Ruhanga agambire, obu omugabe amwizireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba omushaija wa Ruhanga ku yaagambiire omugabe ati: Nyencakare nk'aga magingo, encuro ibiri za sayiri niziija kugura shekeli emwe, n'encuro y'esaano y'obunono egure shekeli emwe omu rurembo rya Samaria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogwo mukuru w'engabo yaagarukamu omushaija wa Ruhanga naagira ati: Noogira ngu n'obu MUKAMA wenka yaakuta amadirisa omu iguru, ekigambo eki kikaabaho? Onu yaamugira ati: Noija kukireeba n'amaisho gaawe, kwonka torikwija kubiryaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyaba nikwo kyamubaho kityo; ahabw'okuba abantu bakamuribatiiririra omu irembo, yaafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
